'An evocative record of a lost age ... unmistakeably heartfelt' Daily Mail
'A poignant and intricately crafted story of love and loss, picturesquely and memorably set on the sea-coast of Cornwall' Stevie Davies, author of Awakening
He turns and waves, twenty feet or so away... she can't swim as strongly as usual. She can taste blood again. Nicholas bobs where he is, letting her catch up. Her nightdress blooms around her like a sail. She reaches him and he touches her arm, very gently. She wants to grab him, hold him tightly in the water. Would he let her?
Cornwall. 1880. Pearl, Jack and Nicholas play among the fishing boats of Skommow Bay, not understanding the undercurrents beneath their games. As they grow older, the choices they make shape the pattern of their lives. 1936 and everything has changed. The fish have stopped coming and the Pilchard Palace is abandoned. Pearl, exiled in favour of holidaymakers, turns to the memory of her great love, and her greatest loss. She's waiting for her own visitor. Will he come for her? The sea's ghosts are stirring. The past can be more alive than the present... A cliff top romance in the style of Daphne Du Maurier and set in a fictional village based on St Ives, The Visitor is a novel steeped in the coast and people of Cornwall. It shivers and flashes with visions as elusive as the fish at the centre of its story."�
�Da b'desh sebe si e strakhotno, da sreshchnesh liubovta e veliko, da imash novi priiateli e super, da uchastvash v izpitaniia e zabavno, no poniakoga vsichki tezi neshcha nakup se prevr'shchat v ogromno predizvikatelstvo i sluchvashchoto se e dalech po-razlichno, otkolkoto ochakvash. ,,Ima igri, koito zapochnesh li da igraesh, triabva da igraesh do kraia, nezavisimo dali pravilata ti kharesvat ili ne."
Mnogo igri shchiakha da se izigraiat, mnogo prepiatstviia shchiakha da se preodoleiat, mnogo neshcha - da se ob'rkat, a dali vsichko shcheshe da se opravi? Na 16-godishnata Lein i predstoeshe da razbere..."�
�Godinata e 1823. Vreme, kogato Amerikanskiiat zapad e diva teritoriia. Zemia, koiato ne e pokorena. Samo smelite i otchaianite dr'zvat da navliazat v neia.
Edin ot tezi m'zhe e Khiu Glas - opiten lovets i traper, koito e napadnat ot mechka po vreme na ekspeditsiia v indianskite teritorii. Ranite mu sa tolkova tezhki, che drugarite mu predpochitat da go izostaviat, vmesto da go nosiat s's sebe si. Dvama m'zhe sa natovareni s's zadachata da izchakat sm'rtta mu i da go pogrebat. Chakaneto otnema tv'rde mnogo vreme i kogato indianski boen otriad se priblizhava do lagera, zashchitnitsite na Glas biagat.
Ostaven na proizvola na s'dbata, ograben i lishen ot or'zhiia, Glas ne umira, a namira sili da p'lzi inch po inch, milia sled milia. Bori se s khishchnitsi, s glada i bolkata ot uzhasiavashchite si rani. Edinstvenoto, koeto go krepi i go tlaska po p'tekata na agoniiata e zhelanieto da se zav'rne v sveta na zhivite. Da se zav'rne i da otm'sti na khorata, koito sa go izostavili i ograbili."�
�Neveroiatna mrachna prikazka za pochitatelite na Niil Geim'n i Luis Karol!
1888 g. Momiche na ime Mir'r i neiniiat misteriozen sp'tnik Goliat pristigat na brega na viktorianska Angliia. Neshcho ne e nared s momicheto ot denia, v koito neiniiat obseben ot ludost diado ia zakliuchva v tainstven chasovnik, obsipan s bozhi kravichki. Mir'r ne znae kakva e, no e naiasno, che veche ne e tochno chovek.
Dzhon L'vkhart, ot svoia strana, ne e roden proklet. No sled zloveshchata sm'rt na roditelite mu e osinoven ot mist'r Fing'rs, demonichen vlastnik na Podzemniia sviat. Niakoi kazvat, che toi e pob'rkan. Dzhon bi se s'glasil.
Sega mist'r Fing'rs ima edna osnovna tsel - da pokhiti Mir'r, chiiato dusha e kliuch't k'm zatv'rzhdavane na vlastta mu za vechni vremena. Chudak't Dzhon, oblechen v paltata si, obsipani s's s'rtsa, vinagi gotov na impulsivna zhestokost, triabva da ia otkrie za nego.
Ako se interesuvate ot:
- smiana na formata;
- kakvo ima v chasovnitsite;
- stranni malki momichentsa;
- sm'rtonosni, no v'zpitani printsove;
- dvanaiset tantsuvashchi printsesi;
- uchastieto na Sm'rt kato personazh.
Tazi kniga e za vas!"�
�Kr'v shche se lee.
Mechti shche b'dat razbiti.
Armiia triabva da se nadigne.
Vladetelkata asasin se e zaklela da ne obr'shcha otnovo gr'b na kralstvoto si. Oshche poveche, che tia mozhe bi e edinstvenata, sposobna da s'bere armiia, koiato da se protivopostavi na Demonskiia kral i negovite zverove. Ala Eravan shche izpolzva minaloto, s'iuznitsite i vragovete na Elin sreshchu samata neia.
